Date: Wed, 1 Apr 2026 15:12:55 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Remove Gemini OAuth support (#698)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

* remove Gemini OAuth support

Google Gemini OAuth adds complexity without sufficient value — users
can use API keys directly. Removes the provider implementation,
registration, mapping, UI fallback, tests, and documentation references.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

* fix: ignore leftover OAuth config for providers without OAuth mapping

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>

* fix: remove leftover Gemini reference in useOAuth comment

